        "text": "We’re introducing new AI-powered tools that help you shape what you see in Feed and Reels by telling us what you’re interested in, in your own words. The post Your Algorithm, Your Words: New Ways to Shape What You See on Facebook appeared first on Meta Newsroom .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
