      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Your Algorithm, Your Words: New Ways to Shape What You See on Facebook",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re introducing new AI-powered tools that help you shape what you see in Feed and Reels by telling us what you’re interested in, in your own words.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Your algorithm and new feedback options, you can directly input your interests to fine-tune what you see, and our ranking systems will adapt in real-time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Facebook is at its best when it helps you find and do more of what you’re actually into.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "New AI-powered tools let you tell Facebook, in your own words, what you want to see in Feed and Reels, and your recommendations respond right away.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can now fine-tune your experience and interact directly with the algorithms that rank and recommend what you see on Facebook, meaning you’ll see recommendations that are more relevant, more nuanced, and more you.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Talk to Your Algorithm, Fine-Tune What You See",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re rolling out Your algorithm, where you can directly add and manage the topics you want to see in Feed and Reels.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "More Ways to Tell Us What You Want, In Your Own Words",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can easily tell us, in your own words, what you want to see more or less of, and your recommendations will update in real time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our ranking systems work to bring you the content you care about – and they’ve gotten remarkably good at it, inferring what you’re into from what you engage with on Facebook: from the posts you like and comment on to what you watch (among thousands of other signals).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Tell it what you want more or less of, and your recommendations respond in real time, adapting within the same session to reflect what matters to you right now.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-your-algorithm-facebook/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:00:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.122Z"
      }
